mple only: cancellation more than 7 calendar days before start may be eligible for a refund less disclosed non-refundable supplier costs.","Demo example only: cancellation 3–7 calendar days before start may incur a 50% fee.","Demo example only: cancellation less than 72 hours before start or a no-show may be non-refundable.","These tiers are examples, not legal advice or a real supplier policy. Publish the exact terms accepted at checkout before launch.","Supplier cancellations, severe weather, force majeure, missed transport and traveller-requested changes must follow the final supplier contract and applicable law.","Refund processing times depend on the payment provider and supplier; do not promise a timeline until verified."]},"changes":{"id":"POL-CHANGE-DEMO","title":"Date changes and amendments","status":"demo template","rules":["Date changes depend on supplier capacity and may change the price.","Changes are not confirmed until written confirmation is issued.","Raise name corrections, participant-count changes and access requests early.","Third-party tickets may have stricter rules than the overall package."]},"privacy":{"id":"POL-PRIVACY-DEMO","title":"Privacy and traveller information","status":"placeholder requiring legal review","rules":["Collect only information necessary to respond to enquiries and manage a confirmed booking.","Explain purpose, retention, access controls and third-party sharing before collecting personal information.","Do not collect passport or payment details in an unsecured demo form.","Replace this placeholder with a reviewed privacy notice before launch."]},"travel_documents":{"id":"POL-DOCS-DEMO","title":"Travel documents and entry requirements","status":"general guidance, not immigration advice","rules":["Entry requirements depend on nationality, passport type, purpose and length of stay.","Check current requirements with Singapore ICA and the relevant embassy or consulate before departure.","Some travellers may need to submit an 